==Trivia==
[[File:GyaradosGeneticApex233 artwork.png|thumb|Standalone illustration]]
The illustration rare print of this card features the [[S.S. Anne]] in the background, as depicted in {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s}}, and multiple {{p|Magikarp}} in the foreground.

===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|HeartGold & SoulSilver|Gyarados|4}} from the {{TCG|HeartGold & SoulSilver}} expansion.
**Both cards have the {{m|Hyper Beam}} attack; this is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Gyarados}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

